{
    "title": "Game of Thrones: Conquest \u2122",
    "description": "The Great War rages! Will you forge your empire with fire and blood? Grow your dragon, raise your army & battle to conquer the Seven Kingdoms with your allies in this 4X strategy RPG game!\r\n\r\nExperience the official Game of Thrones PvP battle & RPG strategy-building game on mobile with Game of Thrones: Conquest. Westeros is at war. Great houses clash, dragons rule the sky. The army of the dead threatens the realm. Build your kingdom & forge strategic alliances. Raise & train your dragon, command troops & battle to secure Seats of Power for your empire. Collect your favorite characters from the award-winning HBO shows and level them up, RPG style. If you enjoy deep, immersive battle strategy games, empire building,  or elevating your war & dragon game, this one\u2019s for you!\r\n\r\nCOLLECT HEROES FOR BATTLE\r\n-  Over 90 heroes from House of the Dragon & Game of Thrones await your command for war, including Rhaenyra Targaryen: The Black Queen & Daenerys: Mother of Dragons.\r\n- Level them up to boost your kingdom\u2019s war, battle, strategy & building stats. \r\n- Use strategy & deploy heroes into battle to reinforce your empire\u2019s armies and win the war!\r\n\r\nWAR STRATEGY & KINGDOM BUILDING: \r\n- This war, battle and 4X RPG strategy-building game starts with you leading an empire & army in Westeros.\r\n-  Build your castle\u2019s defenses & call knights to your empire\u2019s army for war.\r\n- Research crucial technologies for war, battle, your kingdom and economy at the Maester\u2019s Tower. \r\n- Craft powerful battle weapons, armor & trinkets for war at the Forge to build your kingdom's army and expand your empire!\r\n\r\nFORGE WAR ALLIANCES: \r\n- Use strategy to gain your kingdom\u2019s powerful alliances for war & battle.\r\n- Bend the knee or recruit knights & bannermen as part of your kingdom\u2019s war strategy. \r\n- Make your army an unstoppable battle force and forge the next empire in the Great War!\r\n\r\nRPG DRAGON GAME\r\n- Build a dragon pit and receive a rare dragon egg to hatch. \r\n- The Strategy RPG Dragon Game to name, customize & train your dragon to become the ultimate war weapon for your army. \r\n- Raise your army\u2019s dragon to become the cornerstone of your kingdom and protect your empire.\r\n- Care for your dragon and become king! \r\n\r\nKINGDOM VS. KINGDOM PvP WARS: \r\n- Experience PvP battle strategy game action and take over iconic Game of Thrones landmarks like Winterfell, King\u2019s Landing & Dragonstone.\r\n- Strategize, execute and win with your allies in massive PvP battles to defeat whole kingdoms in epic war tournaments. \r\n- Defeat empires and dominate the Seven Kingdoms!\r\n\r\nVENTURE NORTH OF THE WALL: \r\n- Head North of the Wall with your empire\u2019s army & dragon to fight a whole new war!\r\n- Test your kingdom\u2019s battle strength, strategy & coordination by battling unyielding monsters.\r\n- Win exciting loot for your empire on time-limited instances of The Great Ranging & Titans of the North.\r\n\r\nEmpire builders, dragon riders, aspiring kings & queens, PvP battle strategy game enthusiasts, rally to Westeros!\r\n\r\nGame of Thrones: Conquest offers a unique battle, RPG strategy, building game & dragon game experience with unending online wars and thrills. Start your empire and use your dragon to rain destruction. Prevail in war and become the ruler of the Seven Kingdoms!\r\n\r\nPLAY GAME OF THRONES: CONQUEST NOW\r\n\r\nJoin the conversation:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/GoTConquest/",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Great War rages! Will you forge your empire with fire and blood? Grow your dragon, raise your army &amp; battle to conquer the Seven Kingdoms with your allies in this 4X strategy RPG game!<br><br>Experience the official Game of Thrones PvP battle &amp; RPG strategy-building game on mobile with Game of Thrones: Conquest. Westeros is at war. Great houses clash, dragons rule the sky. The army of the dead threatens the realm. Build your kingdom &amp; forge strategic alliances. Raise &amp; train your dragon, command troops &amp; battle to secure Seats of Power for your empire. Collect your favorite characters from the award-winning HBO shows and level them up, RPG style. If you enjoy deep, immersive battle strategy games, empire building,  or elevating your war &amp; dragon game, this one\u2019s for you!<br><br>COLLECT HEROES FOR BATTLE<br>-  Over 90 heroes from House of the Dragon &amp; Game of Thrones await your command for war, including Rhaenyra Targaryen: The Black Queen &amp; Daenerys: Mother of Dragons.<br>- Level them up to boost your kingdom\u2019s war, battle, strategy &amp; building stats. <br>- Use strategy &amp; deploy heroes into battle to reinforce your empire\u2019s armies and win the war!<br><br>WAR STRATEGY &amp; KINGDOM BUILDING: <br>- This war, battle and 4X RPG strategy-building game starts with you leading an empire &amp; army in Westeros.<br>-  Build your castle\u2019s defenses &amp; call knights to your empire\u2019s army for war.<br>- Research crucial technologies for war, battle, your kingdom and economy at the Maester\u2019s Tower. <br>- Craft powerful battle weapons, armor &amp; trinkets for war at the Forge to build your kingdom&#39;s army and expand your empire!<br><br>FORGE WAR ALLIANCES: <br>- Use strategy to gain your kingdom\u2019s powerful alliances for war &amp; battle.<br>- Bend the knee or recruit knights &amp; bannermen as part of your kingdom\u2019s war strategy. <br>- Make your army an unstoppable battle force and forge the next empire in the Great War!<br><br>RPG DRAGON GAME<br>- Build a dragon pit and receive a rare dragon egg to hatch. <br>- The Strategy RPG Dragon Game to name, customize &amp; train your dragon to become the ultimate war weapon for your army. <br>- Raise your army\u2019s dragon to become the cornerstone of your kingdom and protect your empire.<br>- Care for your dragon and become king! <br><br>KINGDOM VS. KINGDOM PvP WARS: <br>- Experience PvP battle strategy game action and take over iconic Game of Thrones landmarks like Winterfell, King\u2019s Landing &amp; Dragonstone.<br>- Strategize, execute and win with your allies in massive PvP battles to defeat whole kingdoms in epic war tournaments. <br>- Defeat empires and dominate the Seven Kingdoms!<br><br>VENTURE NORTH OF THE WALL: <br>- Head North of the Wall with your empire\u2019s army &amp; dragon to fight a whole new war!<br>- Test your kingdom\u2019s battle strength, strategy &amp; coordination by battling unyielding monsters.<br>- Win exciting loot for your empire on time-limited instances of The Great Ranging &amp; Titans of the North.<br><br>Empire builders, dragon riders, aspiring kings &amp; queens, PvP battle strategy game enthusiasts, rally to Westeros!<br><br>Game of Thrones: Conquest offers a unique battle, RPG strategy, building game &amp; dragon game experience with unending online wars and thrills. Start your empire and use your dragon to rain destruction. Prevail in war and become the ruler of the Seven Kingdoms!<br><br>PLAY GAME OF THRONES: CONQUEST NOW<br><br>Join the conversation:<br>https://www.facebook.com/GoTConquest/",
